#. 電子生徒手帳を見る
msgctxt "0001"
msgid "Open e-Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. スキルセット
msgctxt "0002"
msgid "Set Skills"
msgstr ""

#. 準備を終える
msgctxt "0003"
msgid "Finish Preparations"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマが語る学級裁判とは一体…？　犯行現場は自分の部屋、苗木にかけられた疑いは晴れるのか？　そして、舞園さやかを殺害した犯人（クロ）とは…
msgctxt "0004"
msgid "What's this \"class trial\" that Monokuma mentioned? Can Makoto sweep away the cloud of suspicion surrounding him, even with a dead body laying in his bathroom? And what about the blackened who's actually responsible for Sayaka's death?"
msgstr ""

#. 再び始まる疑心暗鬼の学級裁判！　不二咲千尋は何故殺されたのか？　犯人はまた自分達の中に？　コロシアイの連鎖に希望はあるのか…
msgctxt "0005"
msgid "The bizarre class trial begins again. Why was Chihiro murdered? Is the killer hiding within the group? Is there any help to be found in this series of murders...?"
msgstr ""

#. ついに起こってしまった連続殺人…　山田と石丸の命を奪った真犯人は誰だ！？　疑惑が疑惑を生む学級裁判！
msgctxt "0006"
msgid "And now they must confront *two* murders...! Who claimed the lives of Hifumi and Kiyotaka? In this class trial, suspicion builds upon suspicion!"
msgstr ""

#. 複数の容疑者、完全密室殺人…　最も死に遠い人物、大神さくらの殺人を解き明かせ！
msgctxt "0007"
msgid "Multiple suspects. Murder in a locked room. If anyone was likely to survive, it was Sakura. And yet..."
msgstr ""

#. おぼろげな自分の記憶、消えた霧切響子、そして謎の覆面死体… 複雑に絡み合った糸が、運命を紡ぎ出す！
msgctxt "0008"
msgid "Memories float back, Kyoko is gone, and a mysterious masked body appears—the threads holding them all together begin to spin and twine into one..."
msgstr ""

#. たくさんの死を乗り越えて、ついにとらえた真の黒幕。　希望ヶ峰学園最大の謎が、今、姿を現す！
msgctxt "0009"
msgid "The mastermind stands exposed, and must pay for their crimes. Now all that's left is the looming mystery of Hope's Peak Academy itself..."
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判（体験版）が幕を開ける…　犯行現場は自分の部屋、苗木にかけられた疑いは晴れるのか？　そして、葉隠を殺害した犯人（クロ）は一体…？　犯人はこの中にいる！？
msgctxt "0010"
msgid "The curtain opens on the class trial! Can Makoto sweep away the cloud of suspicion surrounding him, even with a dead body laying in his bathroom? And what about the blackened who's actually responsible for Yasuhiro's death?"
msgstr ""

#. ＳＰ（スキルポイント）の範囲内で、スキルを装備することができます。
msgctxt "0011"
msgid "Here you can use your accumulated Skill Points to equip different abilities."
msgstr ""

